  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "The Duo2FA Integration in eCommerceGo SaaS introduces an additional layer of security, ensuring that both admins and users are protected from unauthorized access. This module leverages the trusted Duo Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) system to provide a robust security solution. By incorporating Duo2FA, eCommerceGo enhances the overall security framework, safeguarding sensitive data and user accounts with minimal effort.": "Duo2FA-integrationen i eCommerceGo SaaS introducerer et ekstra sikkerhedslag, der sikrer, at både administratorer og brugere er beskyttet mod uautoriseret adgang. ",
  "Easy Configuration with Required IDs": "Nem konfiguration med påkrævede ID'er",
  "Setting up the Duo2FA module in eCommerceGo SaaS is straightforward. Administrators need to add the required IDs for both the admin and user accounts. This initial configuration is quick and user-friendly, ensuring that businesses can implement enhanced security measures without extensive technical knowledge. The simple setup process allows businesses to promptly benefit from the added security without disrupting their operations.": "Opsætning af Duo2FA-modulet i eCommerceGo SaaS er ligetil. ",
  "Secure Admin and User Logins": "Sikkert administrator- og brugerlogin",
  "Once the Duo2FA module is configured, both admins and users will be prompted to enter a unique authentication code upon logging in. This two-step verification process ensures that only authorized individuals can access the platform. By requiring an additional code, which is typically sent to a user’s mobile device, the risk of unauthorized access is significantly reduced. This added layer of security is crucial for protecting sensitive business and customer data.": "Når Duo2FA-modulet er konfigureret, vil både administratorer og brugere blive bedt om at indtaste en unik godkendelseskode, når de logger ind. Denne to-trins verifikationsproces sikrer, at kun autoriserede personer kan få adgang til platformen. ",
  "Enhanced Protection Against Unauthorized Access": "Forbedret beskyttelse mod uautoriseret adgang",
  "The Duo2FA integration provides enhanced protection against unauthorized access and potential security breaches. With cyber threats becoming increasingly sophisticated, traditional password-based authentication methods are no longer sufficient. Duo2FA ensures that even if a password is compromised, unauthorized users will not be able to access the system without the second authentication factor. This dual-layered security approach is essential for maintaining the integrity of your eCommerce platform.": "Duo2FA-integrationen giver forbedret beskyttelse mod uautoriseret adgang og potentielle sikkerhedsbrud. ",
